  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Readable
  Title: Exhibit IV - Funeral Arrangement
  Body: 'Lilies and nightshade, laid at the Countess''s interment in 1793.


    The
    arrangement is replaced every night. No member of staff will admit to replacing
    it.


    Please do not touch the flowers. They have not been cut.'
  ReadClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d827ef23d1b788f4b92b1131a21aa803, type: 3}
  Verb: Read
