MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2136108285}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a7df911688ca425f8f129e9c77e6df6e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Readable
  Title: The Curator's journal - last entry
  Body: 'They ask whether the exhibits are real. I tell them every piece is authentic,
    and they laugh, and move on to the gift shop.


    The family is waking early
    this year. The thralls in the gallery are restless, and the Countess has stopped
    pretending to be a painting.


    I have sent for a hunter. If they reach the
    Archive, the truth is in the ledgers. I have hidden its key where the family
    will never look: among their own dead.


    God forgive me for what this house
    will do to them.'
  ReadClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d827ef23d1b788f4b92b1131a21aa803, type: 3}
  Verb: Read journal
